<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Microfinance and rural banking are essential tools for promoting financial inclusion, particularly in developing economies where large segments of the population remain unbanked or underbanked. Both aim to provide access to financial services for individuals, households, and small enterprises that are excluded from the traditional banking system.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
